📝 Usage Instructions
Quick Setup for Any Project# 1. Copy template
cp FUNDING.json.template FUNDING.json

# 2. Replace placeholders (manual or scripted)
sed -i 's/{{PROJECT_NAME}}/Your Project Name/g' FUNDING.json
sed -i 's/{{GITHUB_REPOSITORY_SLUG}}/your-repo-slug/g' FUNDING.json
# ... continue for all placeholders

# 3. Disable unused funding platforms
# Edit active: false for platforms you're not using

# 4. Validate JSON syntax
python3 -m json.tool FUNDING.json > /dev/null && echo "Valid JSON"

# 5. Commit
git add FUNDING.json
git commit -m "docs: add universal funding configuration"Placeholder Quick Reference
PlaceholderExample ValueRequired{{PROJECT_NAME}}EZ Cleaner✅{{GITHUB_REPOSITORY_SLUG}}bilbywilby/ez_cleaner✅{{REPO_URL}}https://github.com/user/repo✅{{LICENSE_PRIMARY}}MIT, Apache-2.0✅{{USERNAME}}bilbywilby✅{{AMOUNT}}5000Conditional{{true_or_false}}true or false✅
GitHub Integration
Add to .github/FUNDING.yml for GitHub Sponsors button:github: bilbywilby
patreon: ezcleaner
open_collective: ezcleaner
ko_fi: bilbywilby
liberapay: bilbywilby
custom: ['https://paypal.me/bilbywilby']
